sequenceDiagram
  participant C as claude CLI
  participant H as terminescu hook
  participant PC as plugin-claude
  participant Core as core (links, context)
  participant PG as plugin-git
  participant UI as ContextPanel
  C->>H: PostToolUse Artifact
  H->>PC: hook event
  PC->>Core: AgentEvent::Link {url, name}
  Core->>Core: links::clean(url), add_item(name, rank tool)
  C->>H: Stop (reply with PR URL)
  H->>PC: hook event
  PC->>Core: AgentEvent::Reply
  Core->>Core: extract::find, clean, add_item(rank text or none)
  Core->>PG: CoreEvent::LinkAdded {side_tab, url}
  PG->>PG: gh pr view url (cached 2 min)
  PG->>Core: describe_link(name, badge)
  Core->>UI: items with label, linkType, badge
